flowchart TD
    Start[LLM returned OK or NEEDS_REVIEW] --> Save[Save model_decision]

    Save --> R1

    R1{"R1: Biometric fail?<br/>sim < 90% OR liveness < review?"}
    R1 -->|YES| NR1[NEEDS_REVIEW<br/>code=FACE_DISAGREEMENT]
    R1 -->|NO| R2

    R2{"R2: Biometric rescue?<br/>NR with only FACE_DISAGREEMENT<br/>AND sim >= 98%, liveness passed, 1 face?"}
    R2 -->|YES| Rescue[OK<br/>code=FACE_DISAGREEMENT_RESCUED]
    R2 -->|NO| Gate{Decision<br/>is OK?}

    Gate -->|no| Skip
    Gate -->|yes| R3

    R3{"R3: Guardian consent?<br/>required but not provided?"}
    R3 -->|YES| NR3[NEEDS_REVIEW<br/>code=DATA_MISMATCH]
    R3 -->|NO| R4

    R4{"R4: Stealth minor?<br/>DOB under 18 at reference date<br/>but guardian_consent_required<br/>is not true?"}
    R4 -->|YES| NR4[NEEDS_REVIEW<br/>code=DATA_MISMATCH]
    R4 -->|NO| Final[KEEP AS OK]

    NR1 & Rescue & NR3 & NR4 & Final & Skip --> PostStart

    subgraph Post["POST-PROCESSING"]
